## MediaTek LinkIt SDK

Firmware builds against **LinkIt SDK v4.6.2** for MT7682. The SDK is **not**
included in this repository. It is fetched into gitignored
`external/linkit-sdk-v4.6.2-houndify/` by `tools/fetch-sdk.sh`.

Builds reference SDK example sources **by path** from the local fetched tree
(e.g. `project/mt7682_hdk/apps/fota_over_wifi/` as read-only scaffold). No SDK
source files are vendored or committed under `firmware/`.

Only application code, IV2001 board overlay, partition layout,
linker script, flash-download config, and SDK patch files are in git.

You are responsible for compliance with whatever license terms apply to your
SDK copy.

